(Engineering Operations Handbook - Page 1) ' 
(1. Deployment Cadence) ' 
(Production deployments occur Monday through Thursday between 10:00 UTC and 15:00 UTC.) ' 
(Deployments are strictly prohibited on Fridays, weekends, and designated public holidays.) ' 
(All production releases require passing automated end-to-end tests and approval from two senior engineers.) ' 
ET

endstream
