(Engineering Operations Handbook - Page 2) ' 
(2. On-Call Rotation Schedules) ' 
(Primary on-call shifts rotate weekly on Tuesdays at 12:00 UTC.) ' 
(The primary engineer must acknowledge PagerDuty alerts within 15 minutes for critical alerts.) ' 
(If unacknowledged within 15 minutes, alerts escalate automatically to the secondary on-call engineer.) ' 
ET

endstream
