BT /F1 12 Tf 50 750 Td 15 TL
(Engineering Operations Handbook - Page 3) ' 
(3. Incident Severity Definitions) ' 
(Sev 1 \(Critical Outage\): Core customer-facing services down for >5% of users. Resolution target is under 60 minutes.) ' 
(Sev 2 \(Major Degradation\): High-impact latency or loss of non-essential features. Resolution target is under 4 hours.) ' 
(Sev 3 \(Minor Defect\): Workarounds exist. Fix scheduled in next sprint.) ' 
(Sev 4 \(Cosmetic Issue\): Minor UI glitch with zero data loss.) ' 
ET

endstream
endobj
