(Engineering Operations Handbook - Page 4) ' 
(4. Staging and Production Credentials Policy) ' 
(All engineers must use hardware security keys \(YubiKey\) with WebAuthn for infrastructure access.) ' 
(Production database access is strictly forbidden from personal local environments.) ' 
(AWS staging credentials expire after 8 hours and require mandatory multi-factor authentication.) ' 
ET

endstream
